/* ============================================================
   ROUND 24 — CATEGORY HERO ENHANCER (self-contained IIFE)
   Runs immediately (the hero markup is parsed before this script,
   which sits at the end of body) so title/icon/description/chips
   are populated BEFORE first paint — zero FOUC.
   Only active on label pages: bails out when #mgsLabelHero is
   absent (homepage / item / static / plain ?q= search).
